00:42:57,941 --> 00:43:01,040
So there would always be a couple of fathers missing who had been killed in the refinery

515
00:43:01,041 --> 00:43:02,040
explosions.

516
00:43:02,041 --> 00:43:08,500
In the 20th century, several innovations helped decrease the chances of fire, including

517
00:43:08,501 --> 00:43:10,700
separating the refinery from the storage tanks.

518
00:43:12,520 --> 00:43:14,720
Also, the introduction of floating roofs,

519
00:43:14,820 --> 00:43:17,340
which went up and down with a level of product inside,

520
00:43:18,060 --> 00:43:20,180
kept explosive vapors from accumulating.

521
00:43:22,420 --> 00:43:25,880
Putting out a large tank fire takes experience, guts,

522
00:43:26,500 --> 00:43:27,920
